{
  "id": "p44",
  "title": "The Food Bank",
  "titleZh": "食物银行",
  "topic": "社区食物银行与零售巨头之争",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "Our community food bank opens a small new facility today.",
        "zh": "我们的社区食物银行今天启用一处小小的新场所。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The goal is simple, but money is a serious concern.",
        "zh": "目标很简单，但钱是个严肃的问题。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Every product on the shelf, from bean to rice, is always free.",
        "zh": "架上的每样东西，从豆子到米，永远免费。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Access stays open, and the long queue is mainly local.",
        "zh": "大门一直开着，长长的队伍主要是本地人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A warm invitation asks every neighbour to engage this week.",
        "zh": "一份热情的邀请请每位邻居这周都来参与。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The audience grows quickly, and indeed the whole small room fills.",
        "zh": "来的人很快多起来，那间小屋确实坐满了。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A giant retailer sends a fleet of vans down our street.",
        "zh": "一家零售巨头派出一支车队开进我们这条街。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They blame us for unfair prices and falling local sales.",
        "zh": "他们怪我们压价不公，害得本地销售下滑。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A loud confrontation turns into an assault outside the front gate.",
        "zh": "一场大声的冲突在前门外演变成殴打。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a riot follows, and an unidentified man shouts at everyone.",
        "zh": "接着发生了骚乱，一个身份不明的人对所有人喊叫。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our small margin starts to slide, and we cannot stem it.",
        "zh": "我们微薄的利润开始下滑，我们止不住。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Cash stays tight, and our luck may reverse straight away.",
        "zh": "现金一直紧张，我们的运气也许转眼就翻转。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A bank loan arrives with a hopeful sales forecast for spring.",
        "zh": "一笔银行贷款到账，还附着一份对春季销售的乐观预测。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A new poll predicts a hard electoral fight this autumn.",
        "zh": "一项新民意调查预测今年秋天会有一场激烈的选举之争。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A sharp reduction in waste speeds our slow recovery after months.",
        "zh": "浪费大幅减少，加快了我们在数月之后的缓慢恢复。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My aunt copes for the sake of each hungry child.",
        "zh": "我姑姑为了每一个挨饿的孩子坚持撑着。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later the rules that govern grants are based on real need.",
        "zh": "后来，管理拨款的规则改为以真实需求为依据。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One technical detail in the form delays the aid.",
        "zh": "表格里的一个技术性细节拖慢了援助。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Her profession and her daily occupation are the same.",
        "zh": "她的专业和她日常的职业是同一件事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My artist friend donates prints, and literature fills two boxes.",
        "zh": "我的一位艺术家朋友捐了版画，文学作品装满了两个箱子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a male volunteer in a navy coat lifts heavy crates.",
        "zh": "接着一位穿藏青色外套的男志愿者搬起沉重的箱子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His throat is sore, but his intent stays pure.",
        "zh": "他嗓子哑了，可他的心意依旧纯粹。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Beneath the old stairs we construct a dry store room.",
        "zh": "我们在旧楼梯下面搭了一间干燥的储藏室。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We combine rice and bread as a cheap substitute.",
        "zh": "我们把米饭和面包搭配起来，作为一种廉价的替代。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The daily flow of gifts helps us split the work.",
        "zh": "每天源源不断的馈赠帮我们分担了工作。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "One client is a lover of fresh bread and tea.",
        "zh": "有一位顾客特别喜欢新鲜面包和茶。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My small shop survives, and the whole town starts to heal.",
        "zh": "我的小店活了下来，整个小镇也开始愈合。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Previously the board gave little, but the thirtieth week may affect us.",
        "zh": "以前董事会给得很少，但第三十周可能会影响到我们。"
      }
    ]
  ],
